1
00:00:00,047 --> 00:00:01,577
(knocking on door)
SHELDON:
Penny?

2
00:00:01,582 --> 00:00:02,582
(knocks)
Penny.

3
00:00:02,583 --> 00:00:03,913
(knocks)
Penny.

4
00:00:03,918 --> 00:00:05,388
(knocks)
Penny.

5
00:00:05,386 --> 00:00:07,056
(knocks)
Penny.

6
00:00:07,054 --> 00:00:09,424
(Penny:)You knocked more than usual.

7
00:00:09,424 --> 00:00:10,524
(Sheldon:)Next time I might be in a rush,

8
00:00:10,525 --> 00:00:12,055
(Sheldon:)it's good to have
a few in the bank.

9
00:00:12,059 --> 00:00:13,889
(Penny:)Okay, what's up?

10
00:00:13,895 --> 00:00:16,425
(Sheldon:)I'd like to discuss this party

11
00:00:16,431 --> 00:00:17,801
(Sheldon:)that Amy and Bernadette
are throwing.

12
00:00:17,799 --> 00:00:21,029
(Sheldon:)Since you and I are both
reluctant to go,

13
00:00:21,035 --> 00:00:24,475
(Sheldon:)I think I've come up with a
perfect way for us to enjoy it.

14
00:00:24,472 --> 00:00:25,902
(Penny:)Great, how?

15
00:00:25,907 --> 00:00:27,977
(Sheldon:)We pretend we're aliens.

16
00:00:31,412 --> 00:00:32,982
(Sheldon:)I'm not the best
at reading facial cues,

17
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:35,650
(Sheldon:)but I'm gonna say that you love
it and want to hear more.

18
00:00:37,618 --> 00:00:39,588
(Leonard:)Now,
in the beloved novel

19
00:00:39,587 --> 00:00:41,487
Hitchhiker's Guide
to the Galaxy,

20
00:00:41,489 --> 00:00:44,789
(Sheldon:)an alien named Ford Prefect
pretended to be human

21
00:00:44,792 --> 00:00:48,132
(Sheldon:)in order to blend in so that he
could write an entry about Earth

22
00:00:48,129 --> 00:00:50,329
for The Hitchhiker's Guide
to the Galaxy,

23
00:00:50,331 --> 00:00:52,801
(Sheldon:)which is a travel book
within the actual book,

24
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,070
(Sheldon:)which is also called

25
00:00:54,068 --> 00:00:56,768
The Hitchhiker's Guide
to the Galaxy.

26
00:00:56,771 --> 00:00:59,601
(Penny:)Okay, just one question.

